stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Drafted: analysis or AI nominates
  Drafted --> Refused: policy refuses (reason logged)
  Drafted --> AwaitingApproval: needs the athlete
  Drafted --> Authorized: auto-eligible and all gates pass
  AwaitingApproval --> Authorized: athlete approves
  AwaitingApproval --> Rejected: athlete rejects
  AwaitingApproval --> Expired: evidence or plan changed
  Authorized --> Validating: whole plan re-checked
  Validating --> Refused: validator blocks
  Validating --> Committing: write starts (action id)
  Committing --> Committed: durable write confirmed
  Committing --> Failed: write error shown
  Committing --> Unknown: app stopped mid-write
  Unknown --> Committed: found on next launch
  Unknown --> Failed: not found, retried once by id
  Failed --> Committing: athlete taps Try again
  Committed --> Undone: athlete undoes
  Rejected --> [*]
  Refused --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Undone --> [*]
